            "review_title": "Review at Ebisu Bangai Yakitori & gyoza",
            "review_text": "Uyen Dang\nBelgium, Wisconsin355 contributions\n0\nDelicous dinner\nMar 2025 • Friends\nA glimpse into a typical weeknight in Saigon. Visit Ebisu BANGAI (えびす番外) Yakitori & Gyoza cause I love their yakitori and gyoza; it’s super affordable and so delicious. The interior design blends traditional Japanese charm with modern aesthetics. They have 3 floors with 85 seats, serve top-quality sushi, yakitori, gyoza, and more dishes. Everything we tried was so good, from sushi to fresh seafood to grilled skewers, and the desserts were delightful.\nHighly recommended!\nRead more\nWritten May 1, 2025",
