            "review_title": "Review at Ebisu Bangai Yakitori & gyoza",
            "review_text": "vy\n2 contributions\n0\nFresh and Flavorful Sui Gyoza – A Must-Try!\nApr 2025 • Couples\nI stopped by this cozy Japanese restaurant recently and was pleasantly surprised by how good everything was. The standout for me was the Sui Gyoza – perfectly steamed dumplings that were soft and delicate, with a rich, savory filling that melted in my mouth. The dipping sauce complemented the dumplings so well, adding just the right kick without overpowering the flavor.\n\nThe restaurant had a calm and welcoming vibe, and the staff were polite and attentive throughout the meal.\n\nIf you’re a fan of Japanese cuisine or just love dumplings, I highly recommend giving their Sui Gyoza a try. I’ll definitely be back for more!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 1, 2025",
